    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "polarity": 1,
      "label": "九三",
      "text": {
        "id": "h50-yao-3",
        "original": "鼎耳革，其行塞，雉膏不食，方雨虧悔，終吉。",
        "notes": [],
        "originalRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "skqs-zhouyi-8-batch6",
            "locator": "卷8 / 鼎 / 九三 / 0007冊.djvu/480"
          }
        ],
        "reviewId": "review-h50-yao-3"
      },
      "smallImage": {
        "id": "h50-image-3",
        "original": "鼎耳革，失其義也。",
        "notes": [],
        "originalRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "skqs-zhouyi-8-batch6",
            "locator": "卷8 / 鼎 / 九三小象 / 0007冊.djvu/480"
